          "metric_value": "",
          "unit": "",
          "source_quote": "KT emphasizes that the NPU LLM Station ships as an integrated appliance &mdash; server, model, and API platform combined &mdash; so that organizations can begin running retrieval-augmented generation document query workflows on the day of installation, without a separate infrastructure build-out phase.",
